id: E100
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: configuration
error_signature: CMake Error: TRY_RUN\(.*\) failed to compile|cannot run test executables on this platform|The test executable was not built|TRY_RUN not supported in cross-compiling mode
severity: 3
category: cmake-cross-compile
match_keywords: TRY_RUN, cross-compiling, cmake, configuration, cache file
title: CMake 交叉编译 TRY_RUN 测试失败
root_cause: CMake 检测到交叉编译模式(CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME != host)时，TRY_RUN() 宏会尝试编译并运行测试程序，但目标平台二进制无法在宿主机执行
affected_scope: 使用 CMake 构建且检测为交叉编译的所有软件，特别是 OHOS/musl 平台
verification_cmd: grep -r "TRY_RUN" CMakeLists.txt && cmake --system-information | grep CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME
rec_priority: 1
rec_description: 创建 TryRunResults-<platform>.cmake 缓存文件，预先设置所有 TRY_RUN 变量的结果值，避免实际执行测试程序
rec_command: cmake -C TryRunResults-ohos.cmake -DCMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=Linux ..
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual-cache-file
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_description: 使用 CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=Linux（而非 OHOS），让 CMake 认为是本地编译，避免 TRY_RUN 限制
fallback_command: cmake -DCMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=Linux ..
fallback_auto_fix: true
fallback_impl: auto-system-name
forbid_1_pattern: CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=OHOS
forbid_1_reason: OHOS 不是 CMake 标准平台名，会触发未知平台警告和更多交叉编译限制
forbid_1_consequence: 配置失败或需要更多手动修复
principles: R23-platform-detection, R6-source-only-edit
similar_to: []
source_event: hdf5-1.13.0 cmake configuration
draft: true
contributor_id: 45C7
